ns available to goenv\n   which       Display the full path to an executable\n   whence      List all Go versions that contain the given executable\n\nSee 'goenv help \u0026lt;command\u0026gt;' for information on a specific command.\nFor full documentation, see: \u003chttps://github.com/syndbg/goenv#readme\u003e\n\n________________________________________________________\nExecuted in    1.29 secs      fish           external\n   usr time   64.92 millis   91.00 micros   64.83 millis\n   sys time  114.69 millis  523.00 micros  114.17 millis```","ts":"1615301699.333500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tj/K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae74548a-430e-42bc-885a-37e5a37d8712","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"プロセス起動時に、tccdプロセスが暴走する問題です。\nConsole.appとかActivity Monitor.appなどで確認できます。","ts":"1615301683.333200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"13s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B1BA2925-79FD-42C1-AE4A-C699DFECD62B","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"その結果をキャッシュして実行したら早くなるはず","ts":"1615301672.332700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J2j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8af93ea-bf3b-4a36-9e3d-31c3430f0b51","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```[I] compomize ) time goenv init -\nset -gx GOENV_SHELL fish\nset -gx GOENV_ROOT /Users/skanehira/.goenv\nif not contains $GOENV_ROOT/shims $PATH\n  set -gx PATH $GOENV_ROOT/shims $PATH\nend\nsource '/Users/skanehira/.goenv/libexec/../completions/goenv.fish'\ncommand goenv rehash 2\u0026gt;/dev/null\nfunction goenv\n  set command $argv[1]\n  set -e argv[1]\n\n  switch \"$command\"\n  case rehash shell\n    source (goenv \"sh-$command\" $argv|psub)\n  case '*'\n    command goenv \"$command\" $argv\n  end\nend\ngoenv rehash --only-manage-paths\n\n________________________________________________________\nExecuted in  451.89 millis    fish           external\n   usr time   19.97 millis  108.00 micros   19.86 millis\n   sys time   30.04 millis  506.00 micros   29.54 millis```","ts":"1615301669.332500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tp43"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CDA8A849-A17A-4071-BAE3-EB0647FAD7C2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"timeで計ってみてほしい","ts":"1615301653.331300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ppKy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b06fb8ce-1b11-4a13-b426-6ead2a22e345","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"若干もっさりしています","ts":"1615301650.331100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fMor"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9B5AC7F3-4D41-4583-ADB8-EFD15FB959CE","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、その出力が重くないです？","ts":"1615301642.330500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"11S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43ef56aa-6fdb-4177-8bcf-51a322e00061","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"init - はスクリプトを出力しているだけです","ts":"1615301632.330000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PswU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ad90f7a-3874-4179-8e6e-c607c09f0cef","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"`pyenv` は重いので使わなくなったなー。","ts":"1615301618.329400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LWu96"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68289959-9090-4ba8-9433-0cf2e7b69da0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"いえ、違います","ts":"1615301617.329200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KMAxX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7EE59E5E-F796-465A-8961-76BF127BD436","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"init -がeval相当じゃないです？","t